# Pantry web environment schema (Varlock).
# https://varlock.dev/guides/schema/
#
# Values live in packages/env/ (see packages/env/README.md). Web still reads the
# database directly and needs TURSO_PORT / TURSO_PROJECT for `just local-db-build`.
# Better Auth runs in @pantry/api (reached via the API service binding), so web
# does not pick BETTER_AUTH_*.
# @import(../../packages/env/, pick=[APP_ENV, TURSO_*])
# ---
